  (label "DEVKIT_3V3" (at 314.96 186.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 26964fd3-7632-46b3-9abe-f10209cb46eb)
  )
  (text "Rev.1 active input: externally protected 2S 18650 pack + external BMS only. J4 is BAT+/BAT- 6.0...8.4V; no midpoint, charger or USB-C input." (at 18 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 306bc1ab-62b7-4758-ada9-01685947f6e8)
  )
  (text "BAT+ -> F1 1812L200/16 -> BAT_FUSED -> Q1 DMP3130LQ-7 reverse-polarity MOSFET -> BUCK_IN -> U1 TPS62133RGT -> 5V_SYS." (at 18 26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 625e25f8-29c0-4f29-8c01-ab3f9af3fbb1)
  )
  (text "D3 SMBJ10CA is a bidirectional input transient clamp at BAT_FUSED. No on-board charger/BMS is duplicated; no main-board switch is fitted in Rev.1." (at 18 32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid add24aa8-c994-423a-941e-05afb16eb5da)
  )
  (text "Rev.1 policy: disconnect battery or turn its external BMS output off before connecting the removable DevKit USB-C to a computer for programming." (at 18 38 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9d12779b-a2aa-4162-a70a-fa6e2190c630)
  )
  (text "TPS62133: PVIN/AVIN/EN=BUCK_IN, SW1-3 -> L1 2.2uH -> 5V_SYS, VOS/FSW=5V_SYS, FB/DEF/grounds/EP=GND, SS/TR=C4 to GND; PG NC." (at 18 44 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid de4ca2d5-4209-4740-a6f0-3366cdd236f6)
  )
  (text "J3 is universal E220-T22D: fit one E220-400T22D OR E220-900T22D. M0/M1 10k pulldowns. J5 is removable SSD1306 0.96 I2C, 1 GND/2 3V3/3 SCL/4 SDA." (at 18 50 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 74d5ad80-e0b7-4945-a597-b76a35e8e98b)
  )
  (text "GPIO4 -> SN74AHCT1G125DBVR (OE=GND, 5V) -> WS2812B-V5 DIN. No PCB footprint/layout work is included." (at 18 56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 235e3d49-9c32-4062-a52e-edbdcc8110c2)
  )
  (text "OLED VCC is DEVKIT_3V3 only. R10/R11 optional DNP 4.7k pull-ups to 3V3; fit only after checking module pull-ups. No 5V OLED power or pull-up." (at 18 62 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e9a03eb1-ebce-4a21-ac97-190ec18eab8c)
  )
  (text "TP1 BAT_PLUS, TP2 GND, TP3 BUCK_IN, TP4 5V_SYS, TP5 E220_VCC(5V_SYS), TP6 M0, TP7 M1, TP8 AUX, TP9 RXD, TP10 TXD." (at 18 68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d6c440dc-ce29-4e28-8637-2ace70e5172a)
  )
